### escaped less than in double brackets
[[ 3 \< 5 ]] && echo "smaller"
>>> SC2050 1:6
>>> SC2071 1:6
>>> SC2075 1:6

### quoted greater than in double brackets
[[ $a ">" $b ]] && echo "larger"
>>> SC2075 1:7
>>> SC2154 1:11
>>> SC2154 1:4

### unescaped less than in double brackets is fine
[[ $a < $b ]] && echo "smaller"
>>> SC2154 1:4
>>> SC2154 1:9
